# Build output is committed on purpose.
#
# The official install command for this plugin is the git channel
# (`dsh plugin --profile web add github:crosery/dsh-viewer`), and pnpm refuses to
# run a git-hosted package's build scripts unless the user pre-approves it in
# their profile's `allowBuilds`. Leaving `lib/` out of the repository means every
# user must approve a build, and a user who does not gets
# ERR_PNPM_GIT_DEP_PREPARE_NOT_ALLOWED instead of a plugin.
#
# So `lib/` ships in the repository and `scripts/check-dist.mjs` keeps it honest:
# CI rebuilds and refuses a dist that disagrees with `src/`.
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
*.tgz
